      "text": "Django\n\nWeb framework\nSupports both front and back end\nit's python\nBunch of useful built in packages\nSuper fast while still being scalable\nDocs are very good\nAccessible to begin\nhigh skill ceiling\n\n\nCons:\nCan be tricky to keep track of\nIt's python\nDoes a lot under the hood so hard to read the code sometimes",
